<div class="dw-hero">

!! Docs that anyone can improve, and nobody can take down

DecentraWiki is a wiki you edit in your browser and publish on IPFS. A published wiki has an address of its own, `ipns://k51…`, that keeps showing its newest version, and every version has an IPFS address made from its content. It opens from any IPFS node or gateway that holds it.

Every published wiki carries a pen. Whoever reads it can press the pen, get a copy of their own in the <a class="tc-tiddlylink-external" href={{$:/temp/DecentraWiki/EditorURL}} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">DecentraWiki editor</a>, change it and publish the new version. There is no account to make and no server that decides who may write.

</div>

!! Try it on this page

This guide is a DecentraWiki wiki itself. Press ''Edit this wiki'' at the bottom right of the page: the editor opens with a copy of this guide, ready to change. Nothing you do there touches this page; publishing gives your version an address of its own.

